| GDY-1 | the Mothership | ul. Węglowa 3 (Gate B), 81-340 Gdynia | Mon 00:00 - Sat 22:00 non-stop; Sun 06:00-20:00 | 412 | Urząd Celno-Skarbowy w Gdyni, Oddział Portowy, window 3 | 2100 | plus 24 temp plugs on pad C Oct-Jan (see JL mail 03.02) - NOT counted in the 412!! Gate B only, Gate A is the HQ car park, drivers keep mixing them up |
| HAM-2 | Waltershof | Containerterminal-Zufahrt 5, 21129 Hamburg | Mon-Fri 05:00-22:00; Sat 06:00-14:00; Sun closed | 236 | Hauptzollamt Hamburg-Hafen, Zollstelle Waltershof | 2300 | 236 incl. 16 on the old bund (Greta counted 16 on 12.03 - keep 236). Lane 2 only open after 18:00. |
| RTM-3 | Maasvlakte | Amazonehaven-West, unit 12, 3199 LC Maasvlakte | Mon 00:00 - Sat 20:00 non-stop; Sun 22:00-24:00 only | 184 | Douane Rotterdam Haven, loket 4 | 2400 | contact is Hanneke Dijkgraaf (depot mgr), not the old gate cabin number which still rings in the 2022 leaflets |
| GOT-4 | Arendal | Skarviksvägen 9, 418 34 Göteborg | Mon-Fri 06:00-21:00; weekends by appointment, 24 h notice via Arendal Port Services | 96 | Tullverket Göteborg Hamn, kontor 2 | 2500 | ask for Mats NOT Lars (Lars left in June) |
| KLJ-5 | the yard | Nemuno g. 71, 91199 Klaipėda | Mon-Sat 07:00-19:00, no night gate | 38 | Klaipėdos teritorinė muitinė, post 2 | 2600 | opened 2023. 6 of the 38 plugs are 16A only - no 32A boxes on those, check before you promise anyone a frozen load |
